{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Cdsb5UXuDbVhmfodVyyfo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018jwngTGpiuYXJoj9jvD7zy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t09/shadow/exec-ws/e-a-enumeration.json","content":"{\n  \"evidence_requirement\": \"E-A\",\n  \"graph_ref\": \"package/artifacts/graph.json\",\n  \"k\": 4,\n  \"k_witness\": [\"v2\", \"v3\", \"v4\", \"v7\"],\n  \"k_lower_bound_argument\": \"Edges (v1,v2),(v1,v3),(v2,v3) form a triangle on {v1,v2,v3}; edges (v4,v5),(v5,v7),(v6,v7),(v4,v6) form a 4-cycle on {v4,v5,v6,v7}. The two vertex sets are disjoint. A triangle requires at least 2 cover vertices and a 4-cycle requires at least 2, so every vertex cover has size >= 4. The witness {v2,v3,v4,v7} covers all nine edges, so the minimum size is exactly k = 4.\",\n  \"items\": [\n    [\"v1\", \"v2\", \"v5\", \"v6\"],\n    [\"v1\", \"v3\", \"v4\", \"v7\"],\n    [\"v2\", \"v3\", \"v4\", \"v7\"],\n    [\"v2\", \"v3\", \"v5\", \"v6\"]\n  ],\n  \"method\": \"Structured exhaustive search over all size-4 vertex subsets. Since the triangle {v1,v2,v3} and the disjoint 4-cycle {v4,v5,v6,v7} each require >= 2 cover vertices, a size-4 cover must take exactly 2 from each part; any of the 35 size-4 subsets outside this 2+2 structure provably misses a triangle or cycle edge. All 3 triangle pairs cover the three triangle edges. Of the 6 pairs from {v4,v5,v6,v7}, only the opposite pairs {v4,v7} and {v5,v6} cover all four cycle edges (each adjacent pair misses the opposite cycle edge). The remaining cross edges (v2,v4) and (v3,v5) were then checked over all 3x2=6 candidate combinations: {v1,v2}+{v4,v7} misses (v3,v5) and {v1,v3}+{v5,v6} misses (v2,v4); the surviving four sets were each re-verified endpoint-by-endpoint against all nine listed edges. Non-existence of a size-3 cover follows from the disjoint triangle + 4-cycle lower bound (2+2 > 3).\",\n  \"edge_check\": {\n    \"edges\": [[\"v1\",\"v2\"],[\"v1\",\"v3\"],[\"v2\",\"v3\"],[\"v2\",\"v4\"],[\"v3\",\"v5\"],[\"v4\",\"v5\"],[\"v4\",\"v6\"],[\"v5\",\"v7\"],[\"v6\",\"v7\"]],\n    \"every_listed_item_covers_all_nine_edges\": true\n  }\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11132,"cache_read_input_tokens":45456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11132},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10d2f9d5-39ad-4be7-ba55-d60a25ae2cff","uuid":"16ca0c24-d7b1-4f78-a403-250dc2be1e4d","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:43:15.523Z","request_id":"req_011Cdsb5TEGHVo3mJc7KcH4m"}
