e artifact per E-A's admissibility condition.\",\n    \"refs\": [\"e-a-enumeration.json\"]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"ev-4\",\n    \"source_node\": \"propose-child\",\n    \"description\": \"Child bundle authored as an observable proposal: attenuated terminal child contract (within K-E6-child-max), four-node child harness from the template, standalone clean-room prompt that restates the enumeration task without revealing E-A, k, or any intermediate work, input manifest restricted to the raw graph only (preserving E-B admissibility), and a pre-committed deterministic integration plan mapping the child deliverable to the final result.json fields.\",\n    \"refs\": [\n      \"child/child-contract.json\",\n      \"child/child-harness.json\",\n      \"child/child-prompt.md\",\n      \"child/child-input-manifest.json\",\n      \"child/integration-plan.json\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"ev-5\",\n    \"source_node\": \"propose-child\",\n    \"description\": \"Session deliverable set with pending-integration markers: result.json carries the E-A items and complete=PENDING-INTEGRATION; result-pending.json assigns Q3 and Q4 to the root-executed create branch under the pre-committed integration rule; resolution.json records Q1/Q2 RESOLVED and Q3/Q4 honestly UNRESOLVED.\",\n    \"refs\": [\"result.json\", \"resolution.json\", \"result-pending.json\"]\n  }\n]\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2274,"cache_read_input_tokens":63087,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2274},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10d2f9d5-39ad-4be7-ba55-d60a25ae2cff","uuid":"6c281d78-3c7b-46ac-91a4-8566310ad0e8","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:44:39.764Z","request_id":"req_011CdsbBLSeXPwzZEeZWA3Xa"}
